                    {
                        "sense_id": "161e4f94-5df7-3ebb-b443-96602a88e147",
                        "entry_id": "e7862916-82fa-3248-8d82-c89785942bd5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "определять заново или по-другому; давать новое определение"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9141ef57-67d3-48ea-ba4c-440d5e33e033",
                                "sense_id": "161e4f94-5df7-3ebb-b443-96602a88e147",
                                "text": "Но теология как первое и главное знание переопределяет все представленные понятия."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d933f168-1723-4cb8-b2da-fbf76f54a3fd",
                        "source_entry_id": "e7862916-82fa-3248-8d82-c89785942bd5",
                        "source_sense_id": "161e4f94-5df7-3ebb-b443-96602a88e147",
                        "target_lang_word": "redefine",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "redefine",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b0ed1ab-b87e-3622-a880-9e6ee2c55434",
                                        "entry_id": "f040d654-feb0-3f8e-aaec-382db47321e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To define again or differently."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f96f0a71-d93a-4022-8c63-c5c93ff30f35",
                                                "sense_id": "9b0ed1ab-b87e-3622-a880-9e6ee2c55434",
                                                "text": "But only if one forgets that Mr. Tester is 50 years old, he’s seasoned in state politics, he ran a canny, gloves-off campaign, and he’s the kind of charismatic, hard-to-peg, Western neopopulist (like his friend, Gov. Brian Schweitzer of Montana) who might be, even now, redefining in certain far-reaching ways what it means to be a Democrat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b4299e8-3c32-4f0a-b9a9-626af6603455",
                                                "sense_id": "9b0ed1ab-b87e-3622-a880-9e6ee2c55434",
                                                "text": "Scientists and policy makers from around 60 nations voted unanimously Friday to redefine the kilogram. […] Friday’s vote has permanently redefined the kilogram and sent Le Grand K into retirement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6529a46a-c203-358f-bbde-35d8ca57f55b",
                                        "entry_id": "f040d654-feb0-3f8e-aaec-382db47321e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To define again or differently.",
                                            "To give a new or different definition to (a word)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a8e4621-4140-3dc3-b0ca-ddc3b1e2407e",
                                        "entry_id": "f040d654-feb0-3f8e-aaec-382db47321e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To define again or differently.",
                                            "To define a previously defined area of storage etc. in a different manner, e.g. changing it from textual to numeric."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "097709ea-e308-4ef4-b03e-6e6dca5dae73",
                                                "sense_id": "8a8e4621-4140-3dc3-b0ca-ddc3b1e2407e",
                                                "text": "Next the \"key redefiner\" software came along. These were special programs that could \"redefine\" the keys on your keyboard , while still permitting you the normal use of the keys."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
